# Stage 2 VIP and Critic: the victory trace from the Stage 2 arrivals issue (#14).
# Each turn reads two lines: the Waiter's choice, then the Chef's.
# C2 arrives as a VIP (loses 5 per waiting turn, 10% off) and C4 as a Critic
# (loses 12 per waiting turn, always orders Pasta). Both are served and pay.
# The Critic's Pasta takes two Chef turns, so C5 is seated before O4 is served.
# Result: C1 to C5 pay, revenue $73.50, average 75.6, VICTORY.

# Turn 1: C1 (Regular, Salad) arrives
SEAT C1
WAIT
# Turn 2
ORDER C1
PREPARE O1
# Turn 3
SERVE O1
WAIT
# Turn 4: C2 (VIP, Burger) arrives; T2 is free while C1 eats
