PREPARE O4
# Turn 14: C4 is served at satisfaction 52
SERVE O4
WAIT
# Turn 15
ORDER C5
PREPARE O5
# Turn 16: C6 (Regular, Pasta) arrives; C4 pays $18.00 at satisfaction 52
